    - rid: 1123138610053513234
      type: {class: ArrivalBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A light of its own
        text: Blue light gathers along its wings. The moth settles on the cart's far rail, larger now than any creature that circled the flame.
        continueLabel: Meet the lightkeeper
        duration: 7
        hostState: 2
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        hideNarrativeDuringMotion: 1
        autoAdvance: 1
    - rid: 1123138610053513235
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The Lightkeeper
        text: Your traveler came through here. The blue light waited at the old crossing. I went close enough to hear them speak.
        continueLabel: Ask which road
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513236
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What the light remembers
        text: Win my bargain, and I will tell you what happened at the crossing. Keep pace with the lantern. Its favor never rests.
        continueLabel: Hear the terms
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513237
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What the lantern reveals
        text: This bargain reveals Stored Acorn, Turning Wheel, and Low Roof. Their charms ask you to weigh what you spend against what you keep.
        continueLabel: Hear the terms
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513238
      type: {class: InvitationBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Lantern's Favor
        text: The favored face changes with your next hand. Watch where the light falls.
        continueLabel: Accept the bargain
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4764478fb74a452fbaea5f9c17091d96, type: 2}
